    "title": "SportsGrid: Trends & Scores",
    "description": "Welcome to the most intuitive and comprehensive sports app out there. Period. \r\n\r\nThe SportsGrid app is the complete package, providing you with all the pre-game analysis, game tracking, and post game stats you need as a sports bettor or casual fan. Combine that with the most watched FREE streaming network for live sports betting coverage, news & expert analysis, and you simply won\u2019t need another sports app!\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n\r\n-Access to our 24/7 streaming network, live all day long. Watch or listen to our sports coverage wherever you are!\r\n-Game and prop picks for NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, College Basketball, College Football, and WNBA\r\n-Matchup previews providing odds, analysis, betting game logs, projections, injury news, lineups, line movement, and more in a concise, easy to use view\r\n-Detailed player pages with prop recommendations, stats, splits, prop game logs, health status, and more\r\n-Super fast live game tracking, with easy to access stats, box scores, live odds, and more\r\n-Team and player statistical trends to provide you with the insights you need to make intelligent bets\r\n-Personalized content feed based on the leagues, teams, and hosts you follow\r\n-Bet syncing so you can easily see how your bets are doing while following the games live\r\n\r\nDownload the SportsGrid app now! Whether you're a casual fan or a seasoned bettor, we've got everything you need to stay ahead of the game.\r\n\r\nInformation on the SportsGrid app is for news and entertainment purposes only. What you choose to do with the information provided here is your own decision. Picks added in the app do not include real money wagers, payouts or prizes.\r\n\r\nwww.begambleaware.org\r\n\r\nSportsGrid content is not intended for an audience under 18 years of age.\r\n\r\nSportsGrid Inc. is not affiliated with or endorsed by the NFL, MLB, NBA, NHL, PGA, the NCAA or any other sports league, nor is it a gambling site, and does not accept or place wagers of any kind.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the most intuitive and comprehensive sports app out there. Period. <br><br>The SportsGrid app is the complete package, providing you with all the pre-game analysis, game tracking, and post game stats you need as a sports bettor or casual fan. Combine that with the most watched FREE streaming network for live sports betting coverage, news &amp; expert analysis, and you simply won\u2019t need another sports app!<br><br>Key features include:<br><br>-Access to our 24/7 streaming network, live all day long. Watch or listen to our sports coverage wherever you are!<br>-Game and prop picks for NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, College Basketball, College Football, and WNBA<br>-Matchup previews providing odds, analysis, betting game logs, projections, injury news, lineups, line movement, and more in a concise, easy to use view<br>-Detailed player pages with prop recommendations, stats, splits, prop game logs, health status, and more<br>-Super fast live game tracking, with easy to access stats, box scores, live odds, and more<br>-Team and player statistical trends to provide you with the insights you need to make intelligent bets<br>-Personalized content feed based on the leagues, teams, and hosts you follow<br>-Bet syncing so you can easily see how your bets are doing while following the games live<br><br>Download the SportsGrid app now! Whether you&#39;re a casual fan or a seasoned bettor, we&#39;ve got everything you need to stay ahead of the game.<br><br>Information on the SportsGrid app is for news and entertainment purposes only. What you choose to do with the information provided here is your own decision. Picks added in the app do not include real money wagers, payouts or prizes.<br><br>www.begambleaware.org<br><br>SportsGrid content is not intended for an audience under 18 years of age.<br><br>SportsGrid Inc. is not affiliated with or endorsed by the NFL, MLB, NBA, NHL, PGA, the NCAA or any other sports league, nor is it a gambling site, and does